---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Articles – Luca Kosowski" description="Articles and publications by Luca Kosowski on climate policy, energy transition, and youth activism." canonicalPath="/articles.html" ogTitle="Articles – Luca Kosowski" ogDescription="Articles and publications by Luca Kosowski on climate policy, energy transition, and youth activism.">
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="header-content">
      <a href="index.html" class="logo">Luca Kosowski</a>
      <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
        <span></span>
      </button>
      <nav class="main-nav">
        <a href="index.html" class="nav-mobile-only">Home</a>
        <a href="https://websites.lucakosowski.com/">Websites</a>
        <a href="articles.html" class="nav-desktop-only">Articles</a>
        <a href="projects.html">Projects</a>
        <a href="references.html">References</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="main-wrapper">
      <section class="page-hero articles-page-hero">
        <h1>Articles & Publications</h1>
        <p class="lead">Climate reporting, Energy Web writing, technical localization, and multilingual public communication.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="climate-journalism" class="publication-section articles-primary-section">
        <h2>Climate Policy & Journalism</h2>

        <div class="publication-list">
          <article class="publication-record" id="article1">
            <h3>Scommessa sul clima: un sacrificio o un inevitabile toccasana per il lavoro?</h3>
            <div class="publication-copy">
              <p>An in-depth interview with Simona Fabiani, head of climate and environment policies for CGIL (Italian General Confederation of Labour), conducted during COP24. The article explores the intersection of climate action and labor rights, discussing whether ecological transition is a sacrifice or an opportunity for the workforce.</p>
              <a href="https://stampagiovanile.it/2018/12/14/scommessa-sul-clima-un-sacrificio-o-un-inevitabile-toccasana-per-il-lavoro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-secondary">Read Article</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="publication-record">
            <h3>Deforestazione: siamo verso il punto di non ritorno?</h3>
            <div class="publication-copy">
              <p>A detailed report analyzing the critical state of global deforestation and its tipping points. The article discusses scientific data presented at COP24 regarding forest loss and its irreversible impact on biodiversity and climate stability.</p>
              <a href="https://stampagiovanile.it/2018/12/06/deforestazione-siamo-verso-il-punto-di-non-ritorno/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-secondary">Read Article</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="publication-record" id="article2">
            <h3>Come una studentessa è ispirazione per il mondo</h3>
            <div class="publication-copy">
              <p>A feature story highlighting Greta Thunberg's early activism. We encountered the young activist at COP24 in Katowice, shortly before she became a global icon. The article reflects on her solitary strike and its potential to inspire a worldwide movement.</p>
              <a href="https://stampagiovanile.it/2018/12/05/come-una-studentessa-e-ispirazione-per-il-mondo/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-secondary">Read Article</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="medium-articles" class="publication-section articles-secondary-section">
        <h2>Energy Web & Blockchain Technology</h2>
        <div class="publication-list">
          <article class="publication-record">
            <h3>How can you decarbonize your crypto assets with Energy Web Chain</h3>
            <div class="publication-copy">
              <p>A comprehensive guide explaining the mechanisms for decarbonizing cryptocurrency holdings using the Energy Web Chain. This article details the technical steps and environmental impact of greening crypto assets.</p>
              <a href="https://medium.com/@KappaK/how-can-you-decarbonize-your-crypto-assets-with-energy-web-chain-d3832514a10b" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="preview-link">Read on Medium</a>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="publication-record publication-record--translations">
            <h3>Italian translations</h3>
            <div class="publication-copy">
              <p>As a Brand Ambassador, I translated key technical documentation and community updates into Italian to expand the Energy Web ecosystem.</p>
              <ul class="translation-ledger">
                <li>
                    <a href="https://medium.com/@KappaK/come-decarbonizzare-le-proprie-criptovalute-con-energy-web-chain-299231c9357" target="_blank">Come decarbonizzare le proprie criptovalute con Energy Web Chain</a>
                    <span>Italian localization of the comprehensive guide on decarbonizing crypto assets.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://medium.com/@KappaK/istruzioni-per-testare-il-meccanismo-di-partecipazione-di-energy-web-1778926d89a9" target="_blank">Istruzioni per testare il meccanismo di partecipazione di Energy Web</a>
                    <span>Step-by-step guide on the Energy Web participation mechanism.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://medium.com/@KappaK/liter-di-energy-web-staking-9fb536a5d47d" target="_blank">L'iter di Energy Web staking</a>
                    <span>Detailed overview of the staking lifecycle and mechanics.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://medium.com/@KappaK/parity-technologies-e-energy-web-sono-partner-nel-dare-il-via-alla-nuova-energy-web-consortia-relay-d885afdb32ee" target="_blank">Parity Technologies e Energy Web sono partner</a>
                    <span>Official announcement of the strategic partnership between Parity Technologies and Energy Web.</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://medium.com/@KappaK/le-diverse-opzioni-per-conservare-i-propri-ewt-da7f86a3b0a1" target="_blank">Le diverse opzioni per conservare i propri EWT</a>
                    <span>Educational guide on secure storage solutions for Energy Web Tokens (EWT).</span>
                </li>
                <li>
                    <a href="https://medium.com/@KappaK/energy-web-condivide-il-toolkit-tecnologico-open-source-per-semplificare-lacquisto-di-energia-ed6d071918b3" target="_blank">Energy Web condivide il toolkit tecnologico open-source</a>
                    <span>Launch announcement for the open-source renewable energy purchasing toolkit.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="Contact and website links">
      <a href="mailto:hello@lucakosowski.com">Email</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/luca-kosowski/">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="https://websites.lucakosowski.com/">Website Development</a>
    </nav>
  </footer>

  <!-- Scripts -->
  <script is:inline>
    // Mobile Menu Toggle
    const menuToggle = document.querySelector('.menu-toggle');
    const siteHeader = document.querySelector('.site-header');
    const navLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.main-nav a');

    if (menuToggle) {
        menuToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
            siteHeader.classList.toggle('nav-open');
        });

        // Close menu when a link is clicked
        navLinks.forEach(link => {
            link.addEventListener('click', () => {
                siteHeader.classList.remove('nav-open');
            });
        });
    }
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
